OL,3,GNEWSAHenry Nowak killer applies to
OL,4,Aappeal against conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FVickrum Digwa, the man jailed for
OL,7,Fkilling Henry Nowak, has applied to
OL,8,Fappeal against his conviction.
OL,10,FDigwa, who stabbed the 18-year-old
OL,11,Fstudent with a large dagger in Belmont
OL,12,FRoad, Southampton, on 3 December 2025,
OL,13,Fhas further asked the Supreme Court to
OL,14,Freview his sentence, his lawyers have
OL,15,Fconfirmed.
OL,17,FIt follows a recent hearing in the
OL,18,FCourt of Appeal in which the minimum
OL,19,Fterm of his life sentence was increased
OL,20,Ffrom 21 to 25 years after lawyers for
OL,21,Fthe Attorney General argued that it was
OL,22,Funduly lenient.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
